OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,6,Fand breezy Thursday, with rain for the
OL,7,Flate afternoon. Mostly dry Friday with
OL,8,Fthe odd shower possible. Rain
OL,9,Fspreading in late on Saturday
OL,10,Fafternoon. Temperatures around average.
